, "last_comment_created": 1794561785089, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 7, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATodilpjS", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 35, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8937646, "raw_content": "An individual, except the President, elected or appointed to an office of honor or profit in the civil service or uniformed services, shall take the following oath: \n\n\u201cI, AB, do solemnly swear (or affirm) that I will support and defend the Constitution of the United States against all enemies, foreign and DOMESTIC ; that I will bear true faith and allegiance to the same; that I take this obligation freely, without any mental reservation or purpose of evasion; and that I will well and faithfully discharge the duties of the office on which I am about to enter. So help me God.\u201d This section does not affect other oaths required by law.\n", "author": "cyberrigger", "created": 1794530252372, "profile_picture": "0UVsiKsLavnh", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Hantif", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "5 U.S. Code \u00a7 3331 - Oath of office ", "last_comment_created": 1794538354389, "content": "<p>An individual, except the President, elected or appointed to an office of honor or profit in the civil service or uniformed services, shall take the following oath:</p>\n<p>\u201cI, AB, do solemnly swear (or affirm) that I will support and defend the Constitution of the United States against all enemies, foreign and DOMESTIC ; that I will bear true faith and allegiance to the same; that I take this obligation freely, without any mental reservation or purpose of evasion; and that I will well and faithfully discharge the duties of the office on which I am about to enter. So help me God.\u201d This section does not affect other oaths required by law.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 35, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2120937573355057203", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATodilYPu", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 52, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8937506, "raw_content": "", "author": "kinbergfan", "created": 1794522199103, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "militantnationalist6", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATodilYPu.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/gc22gc/status/2120937573355057203", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "You have to wonder why Nvidia\u2019s ties to China get all the scrutiny while its ties to Israel barely get questioned.\n\nJensen Huang is out. Colette Kress takes over and she usually starts her day talking to Nvidia\u2019s Israeli executives.", "last_comment_created": 1794524342285, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw"